{
  "module": "kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "ff993e4c8e20f93bd760da62ca795ef7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "86433862995aa8d82a40cf1f15afa2fb49d4f8759f08caddc3f28037df5e5687",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「取材」開始",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "cf081b2d2345acb68e2a56616afbb82f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        0,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "783ef5061b39b0d61d1c741cd800343284db0ebffce0591dfbe60cede0b497a4",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「それでは、取材を始めさせていただきます。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "65e3ce3f620ef2c940f4bb3188984633",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "da33a298da317d8e78469ef831d7c043ccd99c6142e24ed282a6c2e237df6aa4",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「ぐちゅ……ぐちゅ……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ee03a189deb3ca29e69b0e68725332ce",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "d07d1143b57bf471acb53affaf5345b0add1929e842b0ffc49c98ce73e8ac2bd",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "選手控室では、レース後の取材が滞りなく進んでいる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e3abe0197f908f817160a439450f0c3d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "012a087f698c273a8ef3a613dcb3e7d15ed239299497031267df0173469db380",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%YOU% のチームの専属記者である %CHARA% は来客用の椅子に座り、レースを終えたばかりの%UMA%に話を聞いていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "44546a9cd107fe757882e0c992072cba",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        6,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "cfa137091b70c91155aa197e82bca8445807c07b843197f9ddba192afad25265",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「まずは本日の勝利、おめでとうございます。今日のレースは……ん……とても、素晴らしいものでしたね。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d2a0a3ee2655d8b825e9f67c0f046d96",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        7,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "06026eef17341fcd9b7c109c740d8327ecf1e3df059fa8bd0a06ef706e293252",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「お褒めいただき、ありがとうございます！今日のレース……勝てて、本当に嬉しいです。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ec2b09779c6258e017821955be86f39c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "74b740b67089d1406d7fdbe2db517e10ab9d7ed2df9a165c9ad70ae384c3ced5",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「ぐちゅ……ちゅぽ、ちゅる……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7a3226f5623b4785b3345f9e196f4487",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        10
      ],
      "originalHash": "45c704b0228ad808f1e714882ad5eb0ba6cc5e266d5a7677aad9b135204ba207",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "ときどき不自然に途切れる言葉と、なぜか室内に響く水音を除けば、取材そのものは順調に進んでいた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d9dec0de2faf4566cec7926a5e11763b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        11,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ba855bc02baaf80cafa8849e6335e55dd25983c845e2614fc9a982729c778ac4",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「で……では、感謝したい方や……視聴者の方へ……伝えたいことはありますか？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7ed543b3271aefb27d52a6c20e628f46",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        12,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ee8ecc2bf10bb300c1ee49bb8173736914868667aff6fc3eb6c08c13727caac2",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「ええ……やっぱり、いちばん感謝しているのはトレーナーですね。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "541dd83ce106c0bc319a9bee8b9da369",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "078536633db6682fcd03a2f2c69e59c450554995c57aba3fb2d3706a1c9bb3e9",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「！ ちゅぐ……ちゅぽ……ちゅるる……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "642a66ab74cd9b98aead8081418d685b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        15,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b87df7c513fbafd61910db291e85e07212dc93cb04a1319bad257674c4106ae0",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「んっ……！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0fb871ee4775e2f28861f0e10c377d7e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        16,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "80b32a9034afbf9f926ecbde04f142eafde19f4cb5543418bb9959e02231b826",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「はあっ……！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b3d586b858e6d31a0e2341acd6f4e722",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        18
      ],
      "originalHash": "69ea1a0eaf14715f769698b93a1078cd1dbdad90704e28481939977058f92e65",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "ふいに——何が起きたのかはわからない。ただ、背景の水音だけが急に早くなり、記者も取材を受ける側も、一瞬、黙り込んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "12a7475517349b44214c7814df1e9e1e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        20,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b95ae6f159b9135a0e781bcf4bcf615648c3c56e9e87d249fad9fafdc03366bc",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「それは……素晴らしいですね。%UMA%とトレーナーが……互いを高め合う、そんな美談。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4eaa31846dc6cf6427ab54003201d9dc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        21,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "0c9371e7b76436aab9523a806eda94795e8db8dbfa104c75ba1ffdd167eb29f4",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「はい……そうです……トレーナーは……いつも私たちのことを考えてくれて……とても……かっこいいんです……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "715739773d92b7445e530963ba41ce49",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        22,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "1c07006dc9289b1424b1f50228bec2d9545dcf6dd05f7d677f45730acefc9b7c",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「で……では、本日は……取材に……応じていただき……出、出ますっ！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f6cf542136e1d81e538d037f01757bcc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        23
      ],
      "originalHash": "74f57466379cf2808c6c58355c8c449abda6b52e5ca5689554017da9cd3916e1",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "意味の通じない締めの言葉とともに、取材の録音は終わった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "027972b77989b65c349d3f678daed7bb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        25,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "9d64dfdb0f173026bad33926a7ad0822b263c3d5a386f42cfae98ad23a61765f",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「あら……これまで、トレーナーさんの育成手腕は一流だとばかり思っておりましたが、お口の方も、これほどとは……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a04102d4c4c0db216d07d432a3523698",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        27
      ],
      "originalHash": "6afaa4cf0312d6342d7964304894084395405cba622ce41bddb5fc7060c32527",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は机の上から、先ほどの取材に使っていた油性ペンを取り上げ、机の下で気ままに何か描き始めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "0d707e361475f4adff3b3fcc977c1f49",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        28
      ],
      "originalHash": "4884fdba18e638af4b7a5667fe2d925d7f5983256c197bce88590540107c2c56",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHAMPION% に至っては、取材が終わった瞬間に手を机の下へ伸ばし、高い平手の音と、その合間に漏れる抑えきれない甘い声が響いた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5e3c112923ef22a43602281f624bed50",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        30
      ],
      "originalHash": "dbcc0115c8f8250f3ade036d5410de206046f607ccb3c9cf31959e835379e495",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "今、誰かが扉を開けて入ってきたなら、眼前の光景に目を見張るだろう。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8de9d2cfc9b2ddc561e5141cf54e10ab",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        31
      ],
      "originalHash": "016de0e0ad3d2a4020b5f3f9d6fd964276feb758579130cc5f9cf6ea7ba48401",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "あるいは……見慣れた風景だと思うだけだろうか。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "83c726abac8577880a901714421bdb08",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        32
      ],
      "originalHash": "8109b2cc09121ae68dedf3de1e2e640a874710c0208e99a0bb05db5a68ee01d8",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "トレセン学園では、もうこういうことも日常茶飯事なのだから。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2d558e3ae5dfcc4ac01ede15176184c5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        34
      ],
      "originalHash": "2d876ce239f1b67bd7f39d3d29894722fbf8a4f85e4eebc5d6719ec84c105ed0",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% と %CHAMPION% が取材をしていた机の下には、見事な体つきのウマ娘が、二人に仕えていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "41de768840061dd3f7fc4e0a20508e3e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        35
      ],
      "originalHash": "b415065225d95409b020d041a4849379b3313645f11934cdc60f58daae98d717",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "そのウマ娘は、トレセン学園のトレーナーのスーツに見える服を着ている。見える、と述べたのは、背に羽織ったスーツの上着だけがまだ服らしく、ほかは——巨乳と、精液で膨らんだ孕み腹に張り裂ける白いシャツ、精斑と引き裂かれた跡だらけのストッキング——服と呼ぶより、ぼろ布か、さもなくば卑猥な衣装と呼ぶほうがふさわしいからだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "de10875763160eb29ad0dba1524366db",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        36
      ],
      "originalHash": "20f134e07410f57ffe3d8a425a83bb83cec2cfa4eae98f9bc3d88651856b5c86",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "彼女は %CHARA% の股間の巨根を含み、後ろはバックの体勢で、%CHAMPION% の平手打ちと注ぎ込みを受けている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8a5c1a63a614d1bd56781ba52dae3bc9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        37
      ],
      "originalHash": "cad7661e17e8db08ddd0bdecd993ceadd15415ffdce3a2af43c6fb851e441ddb",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "今走のメンバーを少しでも知る者なら、なお気づくだろう。この淫らな光景の中心で、前後から挟まれているウマ娘こそ、今日勝った %CHAMPION% の、%C_SEX%のトレーナー、%YOU% なのだと。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "80d7153ecd4307734657b6fb2c0d07d3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        39
      ],
      "originalHash": "19ca61207f1ad292326f17dca4d3c79890c435b4f1bc86a3d8eba8efaeb8d1e1",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は %YOU% の頭を持ち上げ、自分の傑作をじっくり眺めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "085942ee3d772276e1e80f2ecca38e6d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        40
      ],
      "originalHash": "f105f7cfabe2b9a10047e89abc0fd38eab3335bc4f1d0c7ed1ce9ae87d97de03",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "額に書かれた正の字。整った筆致に、記者としてのたしなみがにじんでいる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e553f8b886273a2dd83aff36891045d8",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        41
      ],
      "originalHash": "3397df267fb67f8b1d9e47311284abfd02a3d15fb5c24f86e4503f5dcad059b8",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "左の頬には、生き写しのような陰茎。スケッチの腕の見せ場だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "35a2c382871090d2374b9dd308451814",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        42
      ],
      "originalHash": "3d61541941bd68097133ab33263e2723937ae1bef00fd5d5a85bfbcb396a1ab2",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "右の頬の愛らしい亀は、記者のささやかな童心を示している。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6463794afc414ea8bf0965950040a26f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        43
      ],
      "originalHash": "ce7ef7a4f6e4e6a9d1b4d841d16714b004922b142ef9387c53d7eda7d5ec0473",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "惜しいことに、顔はもう埋め尽くされている。次は、どこにしようか。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5159968c55c64cbed4fe76e75fa809af",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        45
      ],
      "originalHash": "a72c6e293427bd6e1b4339d5d5dbe7196c9b8d2c0cf85283e3633c39c5280712",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "そのとき、%CHAMPION% の激しいピストンに合わせて前後に揺れる %YOU% の、雪白の胸が %CHARA% の目に入った。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ad4d649d672ab7a5ec44afe1019c33e1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        47,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "66bf38f1eec6128bc590aff09267c67200b1b59ff17bcaa7c1817331d84af085",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「そうだわ、まだ空いています！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a46dd2169e04f861791de01067762f38",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        48
      ],
      "originalHash": "3d1df7bbb0c0df80c45796cae265a0e80a250dcb8448f8ebdc917bf8f5050b64",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は %YOU% の巨乳を両手で支え、自分の腿の上に乗せ、胸で陰茎を挟ませた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "65e71228edde2cf00d1681994a0ddc32",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        49
      ],
      "originalHash": "403d970cbba9dcc621e53733d13f72d64bd07dcd1aa641ad2e808feb9842e8b5",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "上半身を持ち上げられたせいで、%YOU% の頭も口の中の肉棒に突き上げられ、机にぶつかって音を立てる。後ろで不満そうな %CHAMPION% が、さらに強く %YOU% の尻を何度か叩いた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "15c09b4b901eadf5695ae3824e5b9b8b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        50
      ],
      "originalHash": "ae2a87b27da9fc3ec2923e60eac69f4c3166d6feec326fbf4def771da2e61eb9",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "頭を机にぶつけないよう、%YOU% は巨根を必死に呑み込み、食道を奥まで満たすしかなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7d5b62f69bf644602ec90ee943ef5b64",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        52
      ],
      "originalHash": "0a5fbd7f5f6b737fdaf28b366fa7b8c010de82b0365ca9c3ebee730145e7956a",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "だが %CHARA% は、そんなことなど意に介していない。目にあるのは、白磁のような %YOU% の胸——新たなキャンバスが増えた、それだけだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "60f331f5f7a2dcbdd2c097a6206afa4a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        53
      ],
      "originalHash": "904cc08d4659112b298a53d35141693767e3084347ffec7f9bd3939b2b6ab1f3",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は少し考え、自分の太い肉棒を包む胸の肉に、自身のサイズをなぞって円を描き、その円をたどって、生き写しのような秘所を描いた——改造を経て、すでに完璧な性具となった %YOU% の体において、乳穴は秘所に劣らぬ締めつけを持つ。襞はないが、完璧に作り変えられた口穴と喉穴が、それに勝るとも劣らぬ奉仕をしてくれる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "76400b95a3e863f35e6cae5fdf67d60a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        54
      ],
      "originalHash": "a31b68fc998c633356602c050eead46f4f62e58488ec169b9eba16ba52032e10",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は満足げに傑作を眺めた。あまり上品とは言えないが、少なくとも、トレーナーの尻に子どもじみた字で『雌豚』『公衆便所』『便器女』『トレーナー失格』と書き散らしている %CHAMPION% よりはマシだろう。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dce82e91e8ad4f48185389beff6634fa",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        56
      ],
      "originalHash": "08f80951b2c4ca706dcc5e1324d6930faf8f61be38bbceb65d144772e5a75f9a",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "ほどなく、%CHARA% の体がひくりと震えた。%YOU% はすぐに、出る前触れだと察して、眼前の巨根にさらに心を込めて奉仕する。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "11d5a69fd75299e12dca12bb23acd230",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        57
      ],
      "originalHash": "1e1a6e6ae603e82952b822d052292b801efce4876507ab20305a554b77657f2b",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "やがて大砲が火を噴き、白濁の礼砲が一瞬で %YOU% の食道を満たした。それだけでは足りず、溢れて %YOU% の口の中が白濁の命でいっぱいになるまで、止まらなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c215926d5177ebd3c19ff9b55dda879f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        58,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "2d96a7f4e0146a6a2b1c0a71519a57f1e0d1c66f3a01d6df9e95a3ad4a5afa13",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「けほっ……けほっ、けほっ」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "516058839b9b602d01236bf74aae3b6c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        59
      ],
      "originalHash": "8052e9f1231221340f23f7c5a686ecd85b452f517c8ccff4b89ba69c8e279a31",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "それでも %YOU% は肉棒を吐き出さずにはいられなかった。まだ射精の止まらない巨砲が、最後の白濁を %YOU% の背へ吹きかける。これで、衣類と呼べる最後の一枚——黒いスーツの上着まで、精液で真っ白に染まった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "67ca1a056de1a917ad56a142a41df0fb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        61,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "ef347c44092732008b41928f32cf44b57efdc7a362d642204cc726a42f1ea4c6",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「情けない……ちゃんと奉仕することすら、できないんですか？」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f97b23ccf29b6b790e2d750063a7d80d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        63
      ],
      "originalHash": "39a8ad2e54b6d0dd378ab3eea9aedbde6086684f6b3502e6aa1c12c100821008",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%YOU% がじたばたしたせいで、穴の中に収まっていた %CHAMPION% の肉棒も滑り出た。先ほどまで肉棒に口を支えられていた %YOU% は床へ倒れ、最初に地面についた孕み腹が耐えきれず、穴から精液を吐き出す。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "bbd337ce983915132cc3554fe64ebae5",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        64
      ],
      "originalHash": "4f9867ea17e872eeb209dcf87be12e985ded87d083cc9c917ff59d3e3137179b",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%YOU% は慌てて二人に土下座し、許しを乞うた。震える体の後ろから、また小さな白い泉が噴き出して床を汚す——もっとも、選手控室の掃除も %YOU% の仕事のうちだ。唯一無傷だったスーツの上着は、まさにそのためのものだった。今は精液だらけだ……となると、トレーナーさんは自分の体で床を拭くしかない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5abd56d3105c8fdc5bdd878acda1f7f2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        66
      ],
      "originalHash": "67ccb120678eeffd5102cfcd2735d19a90be1b9f8534edf83745996bce57b319",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% は首を振り、この程度は気にしていない、と示した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "620a23087f05f8cf083d15ecc18e83dd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        68,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d8063b3a29657458a03e29a22f227e16644c748900e304d56edca7263347e889",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "「本日の取材もこれで終わりです。そろそろ戻りますね。お二人とも、今日はありがとうございました。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f5bc88c6fe6da0af435b2e30938e850a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/900300-Otonashi-Etsuko/love-303.kojo",
      "key": "rape_after_race",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rape_after_race",
        "lines",
        70
      ],
      "originalHash": "e3c66138216f12eef3ef9269dcb39e8a1f68c91134841c8e42d07f7f7027f87b",
      "sourceFileHash": "f362fee71c3bee6d71f45b588a06f6ce98948096f4d650cc6d3df95ec0523e0e",
      "originalText": "%CHARA% の合図を聞くと、%YOU% はすぐ前へ出て、射精したばかりでまだ硬い肉棒を含み、仕上げの清掃に入った。先ほどの途中だった仕事を、ここで果たす。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "07ea57c266de786141ace88334ec3d0b",
